---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/layout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Shaheen Al Adwani"
  description="How shaheen.works handles personal information: what the contact form collects, browser preference storage, and your rights."
>
  <main id="main" class="wrap pt-10 pb-16">
    <h1 class="text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em]">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[12px] faint">Effective 2026-09-25 · shaheen.works</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-[14px] muted leading-[1.7]">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Summary</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-[7px] w-1 h-1 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-[color:var(--border-strong)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>This site sets no cookies, runs no analytics, and includes no tracking or advertising.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-[7px] w-1 h-1 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-[color:var(--border-strong)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>The only personal data it receives is what you type into the contact form.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-[7px] w-1 h-1 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-[color:var(--border-strong)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>A few interface preferences (theme, sound, filters) are stored in your browser's local storage — only if you allow them — and never leave your device.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Who is responsible</h2>
        <p>
          This website is operated by Shaheen Al Adwani, Davao City, Philippines
          ("I", "me"). For any privacy question or request, contact
          <a href="mailto:contact.shaheenaladwani@gmail.com" class="fg hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">contact.shaheenaladwani@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Information the contact form collects</h2>
        <p>
          If you send a message through the contact form, I receive: your name,
          your work email address, the hiring interest you select, and the
          optional note you write. This information is used only to read and
          respond to your message. Submitting the form is your consent to this
          use; if you prefer not to share it, use the email address above
          directly instead.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">How form data is processed</h2>
        <p>
          The form submits to this site's own endpoint (a Netlify serverless
          function) and is delivered by email through Resend to my mailbox.
          Processors involved: Netlify (hosting and function execution) and
          Resend (email delivery). Messages are kept in my mailbox for as long
          as our correspondence requires, then deleted.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Browser preference storage</h2>
        <p>
          The site can store four values in your browser's local storage: your
          theme choice (light or dark), interface sound on or off, your
          selected work filter, and your consent choice itself. These values
          never leave your browser, are not readable by other sites, and can be
          cleared at any time in your browser settings. Preference values are
          written only after you choose "Allow preferences"; if you choose
          "Essential only", only the consent record itself is stored, so the
          site remembers your choice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Third-party content and links</h2>
        <p>
          Some project videos are streamed from Cloudinary; like any CDN, its
          servers see the IP address used to request the video. The site also
          links to third-party services (for example Google Appointments,
          GitHub, LinkedIn). Once you follow a link, the destination's own
          privacy policy applies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Under the Philippine Data Privacy Act (RA 10173), and — for visitors
          located in the EU or EEA — under the GDPR-equivalent principles this
          site voluntarily follows, you may request access to the personal data
          I hold about you, ask for corrections, ask for deletion, withdraw
          consent, and ask for a copy of your data. To exercise any of these,
          email
          <a href="mailto:contact.shaheenaladwani@gmail.com" class="fg hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">contact.shaheenaladwani@gmail.com</a>;
          I will respond within 30 days. Philippine residents may also raise
          concerns with the National Privacy Commission; EU residents with
          their local data protection authority.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Children</h2>
        <p>
          This site is not directed at children. Personal data should not be
          submitted by anyone under 13, or under a higher age where local law
          requires.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">International transfers</h2>
        <p>
          Netlify and Resend may process data outside the Philippines. Where
          personal data is transferred, appropriate safeguards apply,
          consistent with this policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Changes</h2>
        <p>
          This policy may be updated; the effective date above will change when
          it does. Material changes will be highlighted on this page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight fg">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Shaheen Al Adwani ·
          <a href="mailto:contact.shaheenaladwani@gmail.com" class="fg hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">contact.shaheenaladwani@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>